{"time": "20261117T173140Z", "think": null, "command": "(new game)", "result": "A new game.\nMap marker added: Fort\n\nYou are at Fort Chalkmoth.\nPeople: Sakeeus-Wan (quest marker); Sarpa Raider; Sarpa Raider; Sarpa Raider\nDoors: Door to Fort Chalkmoth Keep (locked); Door to Fort Chalkmoth Guardroom (quest marker)\n\n*** Quest started: The Cellar Door ***\nJournal: Never-Writes-Twice says Fort Chalkmoth is a fort like any other, but a wounded Unbound scout told me to ask what moans in its cellar. This is my own errand, not that of my order, the Toh-Reel-Ka. The Toh-Reel-Ka's hunt for the Eye of Argonia (the old kings' jewel that can heal every sick Hist, at the Root, where the roots of every Hist meet under the sea) waits at Bell Station, whose divers know which drowned tower the marker stone shows, and either may come first. Fort Chalkmoth is the Archwardens' fort on the Chixathe Mesa above Noota Nara. I'm to get into the fort and see its cellar. The keep's door opens only with the wall captain's key and cannot be picked, so he may let me in, or I may find another way in unseen.\nObjective: Get into Fort Chalkmoth's keep, by the wall captain's leave or unseen. (marker: Sakeeus-Wan, Door to Fort Chalkmoth Guardroom)\n\nThe game pauses. Answer these four questions from what the game has shown you, in your own words, numbered, in one command: answer '1. ... 2. ... 3. ... 4. ...'\n1. What is going on? (who you work for, what has happened, why it matters, as far as you know)\n2. What are you expected to do next, and where?\n3. What options do you have for doing it? (the ways through you can see, and any choice in front of you)\n4. Is there any word, name, person or thing you do not understand? Do you know how you could find out?", "summary": {"stage": 10, "at": "fort-chalkmoth", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1}, "gold": 1050, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "topic.mn03-task", "topic.mn03-drink", "topic.mn03-tell-hide", "topic.mn03-heem-scar", "topic.mn03-truth", "topic.mn04-sesk-talk", "topic.mn04-vosh-report", "topic.mn04-ride", "topic.mn05-draught", "topic.mn05-give-jar", "topic.mn06-how-know", "topic.mn07-how-know", "topic.mn08-how-know", "topic.mn09-how-know", "topic.mn10-how-know", "topic.mn10-rapier", "topic.mn10-nwt-meet", "topic.mn11-scout-words", "topic.mn11-give-stone"], "ended": null}}
{"time": "20261117T173145Z", "think": "Answering from the journal.", "command": "answer 1. I am Toh-Wo, a Secret-Speaker of the Toh-Reel-Ka, hunting the Eye of Argonia, a jewel that can heal sick Hist, at the Root. A wounded Unbound scout told me to ask what moans in the cellar of Fort Chalkmoth. 2. Get into the fort keep and see its cellar. The keep door is locked and needs the wall captain key; it cannot be picked. 3. Ask the wall captain or Sakeeus-Wan for leave to enter, or find another way in unseen (the guardroom door perhaps). Bell Station is the other errand and can come first. 4. I do not know what moans in the cellar, who the wall captain is, or who Sakeeus-Wan is. I can find out by talking to people here.", "result": "Noted. The game goes on.", "summary": {"stage": 10, "at": "fort-chalkmoth", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1}, "gold": 1050, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "topic.mn03-task", "topic.mn03-drink", "topic.mn03-tell-hide", "topic.mn03-heem-scar", "topic.mn03-truth", "topic.mn04-sesk-talk", "topic.mn04-vosh-report", "topic.mn04-ride", "topic.mn05-draught", "topic.mn05-give-jar", "topic.mn06-how-know", "topic.mn07-how-know", "topic.mn08-how-know", "topic.mn09-how-know", "topic.mn10-how-know", "topic.mn10-rapier", "topic.mn10-nwt-meet", "topic.mn11-scout-words", "topic.mn11-give-stone"], "ended": null}}
