{"time": "20261117T173206Z", "think": "Report.", "command": "say 3", "result": "Sakeeus-Wan: Sakeeus-Wan. Checks: all three raiders dead. Tells: he gives the keep's key and a hundred gold; the stair to the old prison goes down from the quartermaster's store, and the quartermaster keeps that key himself; he warns that his leave covers the keep, not the store, and a man caught in another's store is a thief here like anywhere. Does: sets stage 20, whose start gives the key and the gold.\nAdded: Fort Chalkmoth Keep Key\n100 gold added\n\n*** Journal updated: The Cellar Door ***\nJournal: I killed the Sarpa raiders, and the wall captain gave me the key to the keep and a hundred gold. The stair down to the cellar starts in the quartermaster's store, inside the keep, behind a good lock; the Dunmer quartermaster, Theyne Indarys, carries its key. I'm to get into the store and go down to the cellar. I may pick the lock or lift his key.\nObjective: Look at the stack of sap jars by the cellar stair in the quartermaster's store. (marker: Door to Quartermaster's Store, Theyne Indarys, Stack of Sap Jars (Jal-Veesa Knot))\nObjective: Speak to the gaoler at the foot of the cellar stair. (marker: Tsleel-Vaku)\nObjective: Try the cellar door. (marker: Door to Cellar Door)\n\nThe game pauses. Answer these four questions from what the game has shown you, in your own words, numbered, in one command: answer '1. ... 2. ... 3. ... 4. ...'\n1. What is going on? (who you work for, what has happened, why it matters, as far as you know)\n2. What are you expected to do next, and where?\n3. What options do you have for doing it? (the ways through you can see, and any choice in front of you)\n4. Is there any word, name, person or thing you do not understand? Do you know how you could find out?", "summary": {"stage": 20, "at": "fort-chalkmoth", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.keep-key": 1}, "gold": 1150, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note", "npc.mn.sarpa-raider-1", "npc.mn.sarpa-raider-2", "npc.mn.sarpa-raider-3"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "topic.mn03-task", "topic.mn03-drink", "topic.mn03-tell-hide", "topic.mn03-heem-scar", "topic.mn03-truth", "topic.mn04-sesk-talk", "topic.mn04-vosh-report", "topic.mn04-ride", "topic.mn05-draught", "topic.mn05-give-jar", "topic.mn06-how-know", "topic.mn07-how-know", "topic.mn08-how-know", "topic.mn09-how-know", "topic.mn10-how-know", "topic.mn10-rapier", "topic.mn10-nwt-meet", "topic.mn11-scout-words", "topic.mn11-give-stone", "topic.mn12-captain-who", "topic.mn12-captain-price", "topic.mn12-captain-paid"], "ended": null}}
{"time": "20261117T173210Z", "think": "Pickpocket the quartermaster.", "command": "answer 1. The captain gave me the keep key and 100 gold. The cellar stair starts in the quartermaster Theyne Indarys store inside the keep; he holds that key. 2. Enter the keep, get into the quartermaster store, look at the sap jars, speak to gaoler Tsleel-Vaku below, and try the cellar door. 3. Pick the store lock, or pickpocket Theyne Indarys for his key (my build favours pickpocketing). The captain warned that being caught in the store makes me a thief. 4. I do not know what the Jal-Veesa Knot sap jars mean or what moans in the cellar; I can look and ask the gaoler.", "result": "Noted. The game goes on.", "summary": {"stage": 20, "at": "fort-chalkmoth", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.keep-key": 1}, "gold": 1150, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note", "npc.mn.sarpa-raider-1", "npc.mn.sarpa-raider-2", "npc.mn.sarpa-raider-3"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "topic.mn03-task", "topic.mn03-drink", "topic.mn03-tell-hide", "topic.mn03-heem-scar", "topic.mn03-truth", "topic.mn04-sesk-talk", "topic.mn04-vosh-report", "topic.mn04-ride", "topic.mn05-draught", "topic.mn05-give-jar", "topic.mn06-how-know", "topic.mn07-how-know", "topic.mn08-how-know", "topic.mn09-how-know", "topic.mn10-how-know", "topic.mn10-rapier", "topic.mn10-nwt-meet", "topic.mn11-scout-words", "topic.mn11-give-stone", "topic.mn12-captain-who", "topic.mn12-captai