{"time": "20261117T173230Z", "think": "Quest ended; answer.", "command": "answer 1. The cellar of Fort Chalkmoth is the order own store; Hist sap jars from Jal-Veesa are stacked by the stair in a fort with no Hist of its own, and something moans behind the locked inner door. The gaoler Tsleel-Vaku refused me; Never-Writes-Twice keeps the key. 2. Go back to the hunt: Bell Station, east of Lilmoth, to ask the divers which drowned tower the marker stone shows. 3. I could return to Never-Writes-Twice and ask about the cellar, or go to Bell Station. 4. I do not know who or what moans in the cellar, or why the order feeds it sap. I could ask Never-Writes-Twice.", "result": "Noted.\n\nThe quest is over. Write your notes: what you now know and have, as you would tell a friend picking up your save. Give them in one command: answer '...'", "summary": {"stage": 90, "at": "Fort Chalkmoth Guardroom", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.keep-key": 1, "thing.mn12.store-key": 1}, "gold": 1150, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.jars-seen": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note", "npc.mn.sarpa-raider-1", "npc.mn.sarpa-raider-2", "npc.mn.sarpa-raider-3"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "topic.mn03-task", "topic.mn03-drink", "topic.mn03-tell-hide", "topic.mn03-heem-scar", "topic.mn03-truth", "topic.mn04-sesk-talk", "topic.mn04-vosh-report", "topic.mn04-ride", "topic.mn05-draught", "topic.