{"time": "20261117T173234Z", "think": "Final notes.", "command": "answer I am Toh-Wo of the Toh-Reel-Ka. At Fort Chalkmoth I killed three Sarpa raiders for wall captain Sakeeus-Wan and got the keep key and 100 gold. I lifted the quartermaster Theyne Indarys store key. Jars of Hist sap from Jal-Veesa tree-minder are stacked by the cellar stair, though the fort has no Hist of its own. Gaoler Tsleel-Vaku guards the locked inner cellar door and refused me, persuasion and illusion failed; Never-Writes-Twice keeps that key. Something moans behind it; I do not know who or why. I still carry the rapier, lockpicks, seals, recipe, about 1150 gold, and the stolen store key. Next: Bell Station near Lilmoth for the drowned tower, or pick the cellar door lock later, or ask Never-Writes-Twice. Still unknown: the Root, the Eye, the Collector, and what is in the cellar.", "result": "Thank you. Your notes are kept; the game is over. You can stop now.", "summary": {"stage": 90, "at": "Fort Chalkmoth Guardroom", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.keep-key": 1, "thing.mn12.store-key": 1}, "gold": 1150, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.jars-seen": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note", "npc.mn.sarpa-raider-1", "npc.mn.sarpa-raider-2", "npc.mn.sarpa-raider-3"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "topic.mn03-task", "topic.mn03-drink", "topic.mn03-tell-hide", "topic.mn03-heem-scar", "topic.mn03